SUMMARY:PRS Database: rule starts for the South East (draft)
DESCRIPTION:PRS Database dates for the South East. Rule starts: 15 March 20
 27. Register by: 14 June 2027.\n\nThe start date is in the draft Private R
 ented Sector Database Regulations 2026. The register-by date comes from Go
 vernment guidance on the Housing Hub. We last checked both on 3 October 20
 26. The regulations were still draft then\, so the dates could change.\n\n
 Check before you rely on these dates.\nGuide: https://innovatedigi.github.
 io/landlord-tracker/guides/prs-database-south-east/\nOfficial page: https:
 //housinghub.campaign.gov.uk/renting-is-changing/get-ready-to-register/\n
 \nThis is general information\, not legal advice. Innovate Digital is an i
 ndependent business and is not affiliated with Innovate UK or UKRI.
